  "description": "2007-2013 Toyota Tundra & 2008-2017 Toyota Sequoia. But very important is that the headlights are not fit for a vehicle with an electric adjustment function.\nFitment\n2008-2017 Toyota Sequoia\n2007-2013 Toyota Tundra\nNot suitable for a vehicle with an electric adjustment function\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility - Headlight assembly compatible with 2007 2008 2009 2010 2011 2012 2013 Toyota Tundra; 2008 2009 2010 2011 2012 2013 2014 2015 2016 2017 Toyota Sequoia. High/low beam bulb type: HB3/H11. Note: Bulbs and wiring harness are NOT included. Please verify your vehicle's model and year before purchase\nWaterproof– Fully sealed with solid silicone and equipped with one-way pressure-equalizing vents, the housing prevents moisture buildup and condensation\nEnhanced Brightness – The metallic parabolic reflectors optimize light output, delivering a broader, smoother, and more focused beam. Experience enhanced nighttime visibility and reduced eye strain for safer driving\nSide Safety Reflector – Built-in micro-prism reflectors on the sides make your vehicle highly visible to oncoming traffic and pedestrians at night. This passive safety feature ensures you are seen from all angles, reducing collision risks\nDirect Replacement– Professional Installation would be highly recommended; come as a pair, including Driver (Left) & Passenger (Right) side",
